 },
 "summary": "D882H is a single NPN bipolar transistor in the three-lead SOT-89 surface-mount package, rated 70 V collector-base and collector-emitter and 3.0 A collector current. Its gain is 160 to 320 at 1 A and 2 V, collector-emitter saturation stays under 0.5 V at 2 A with 0.2 A base drive, and dissipation is 500 mW at 25 °C ambient. It is meant for high-voltage switching and amplifying work, telephony among the uses.",
