  {
   "topic": "Package materials",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "The SOT-89 body is moulded in a compound rated UL 94V-0 for flammability; the part is RoHS-compliant and free of halogens. Its leads are solder plated and pass solderability testing to MIL-STD-750 Method 2026."
